      "message": "I\u0027m just curious here - did you tried to just do ADD source without Removing it ? According to Spec (BASS 3.1.1.4 Add Source operation) It should be fine/enough. Do you see any another benefit from having two operations ? I\u0027m also wondering how vendors handles \"Only\" Add source operation...\n\nBesides of that this change looks valid and I understand a motivation to: clean (remove), add.",
